WEBVTT

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:05.700
What are the results?

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.600
It isn't definitive, 
but it seems there is potential.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:13.840
All that's left is to make 
contact with that person.

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:17.360
It's time for me to go to my part-time job.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.790
Yukimura-kun, you're working 
as a home tutor, aren't you?

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:23.130
What is your student like?

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.430
She lacks seriousness and can be lazy,

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:28.670
but when she's taught, 
her progress is certain.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.670
She is a brilliant woman.

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:32.650
Wow.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:35.190
What? Woman?

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:36.370
A high school girl?

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:42.630
Yukimura-sensei, how do I find 
the reaction force on object A?

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:44.600
Well, you go like this...

00:00:45.130 --> 00:00:48.160
and add the pressure force 
F with your fingers.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.770
Oh, Sensei, you're so silly.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:54.190
What do you think you're 
doing, ogling a minor?!

00:00:54.190 --> 00:00:56.410
You pervert! You criminal!

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.500
How did you end up thinking that?!

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:21.850
<b>Science Fell in Love, 
So I Tried to Prove It [r=1-sinθ]</b>

