It's looking good!

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.980
Welcome back, Kosuke-kun.

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:27.760
Hey, I saw maid-Kanadecchi out there.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.450
Does that mean we're already...

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:31.870
Yes. Your timing is perfect.

