00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:44.640
<b>Works in Apparel</b>

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:44.640
<b>Hoshikami Kirara</b>

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:44.630
I'm Kirari!

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:48.060
Wait! Hold on a sec!

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:51.430
Could it be that you're 
the KiraKira Sisters?

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:53.590
Oh, you know about us?

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:55.170
I'm so happy!

00:09:55.730 --> 00:09:57.900
They've got over a million followers!

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:01.100
As soon as they upload a cosplay pic, 
it goes super-viral!

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:04.670
Twin cosplayers who are super-famous 
on the net! You're them?!

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:07.390
Why haven't you ever introduced me to them?!

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:09.540
Because you're like that.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.850
We heard that we'd get to help 
lots of people cosplay today,

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:14.430
so we've been looking forward to it!

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:17.470
We do our own hair and make-up, so...

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:19.180
just leave it to us!

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:23.660
For this, in order to investigate the 
effect appearance has on romance,

00:10:24.030 --> 00:10:27.570
we will perform many transformations 
of our subjects' looks.

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:29.190
Okay!

00:10:29.470 --> 00:10:33.930
First, we should begin with this 
very important experiment.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:36.220
Dress as a woman, you say?

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:38.440
You're saying that to me?

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:41.190
I have no time to be 
playing around like that.

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:45.710
This is serious research into measuring the 
importance of physical attractiveness.

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:49.840
Y-You're right. I won't force you.

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:55.380
But it provides an opportunity to analyze 
the effect of a drastic change in appearance...

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:58.330
and... on a personal level...

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:02.590
Yukimura-kun, no matter what you wear...

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:04.720
no matter how you might look...

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:07.350
I believe I would want to 
stay in love with you.

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:10.230
Bah!

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:14.740
Data on extreme changes in appearance... 
It's true that we do need that, too.

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:19.260
And my dressing as a woman

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:21.860
will simply cause a dramatic decrease 
in my attractiveness. That's all.

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:26.230
Yukimura-san, with your build, 
I'd recommend an A-line dress.

00:11:26.230 --> 00:11:27.710
It's so cute!

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:31.750
It will raise your waistline and 
give you a feminine silhouette!

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:34.240
<i>What is this chill I feel?!</i>

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:38.250
Yukimura-san, your skin is so 
fair and pretty, I'm jealous!

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:41.390
What wig would suit you best?

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:43.380
I...

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:45.500
Please close your eyes.

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:48.510
I'll make you super-pretty, okay?

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:49.980
It couldn't be...

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:52.760
It's all right. Don't be scared.

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:56.970
Have I fallen into a trap from 
which there is no escape?!

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:01.200
See?

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.780
You're lovely!

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:09.300
<i>Th-This... is me?</i>

00:12:09.650 --> 00:12:11.780
You're so cute!

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:16.040
Yukimura-kun, even if you were a 
girl, I'd be totally fine with it!

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:20.120
Get a grip, me!

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:22.790
That's a man. It's Yukimura-senpai!

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:26.670
He's not cute. Not cute at all!

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:28.870
Look.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:33.940
Kosuke...

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:37.310
I'm not cute?

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:40.490
Of course you're cute!

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:43.320
You are pretty, my angel!

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:47.520
You are supremely lovely.

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:50.800
And since it is I, who lives for 
love of beautiful girls, saying it,

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:52.210
there can be no mistake.

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:54.590
He's right, Yukimura-san!

00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:56.480
Please have more confidence in yourself!

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:58.210
You're definitely cute!

00:12:58.530 --> 00:12:59.980
<i>It's true.</i>

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:03.480
<i>Even I... can become cute.</i>

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:05.330
<i>I...</i>

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:06.920
<i>have been transformed!</i>

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:13.620
I feel like I've woken 
from a hellish nightmare.

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:16.570
What a coincidence, Yukimura-senpai.

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:18.350
So do I.

00:13:18.630 --> 00:13:20.480
And he was so cute, too.

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:22.480
I wanted to look at him some more.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:27.010
Still, cosplay really is amazing, isn't it?

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:29.750
I never imagined you could dress 
him so perfectly as a woman.

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:32.500
People can change quite a lot, you know?

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:34.610
Which means...

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:37.290
Now it's your turn, Himuro-san!

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:38.230
What?!

